            "review_title": "Review at Wanozen",
            "review_text": "Tài V\n8 contributions\n0\nDrinking is fun.\nMar 2026 • Friends\nWe called a 309k grill set, plus a 30k cup of rice. Set for 2 people to eat steak + karaage chicken + teriyakako chicken + baked pigs + pasta salad. The quality is equal, I prefer chicken teriyaki. The cow steak is like Ushi Mania, a bit hard, but fever is a bit boring. Drinking is fun and eating is great, so you can eat a lot.\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 28, 2026",
